sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Caller as API caller
    participant RequestLog as RequestLogMiddleware<br/>src/todo/api/http/middleware/request_log/middleware.py
    participant AnswerFailures as AnswerFailuresMiddleware<br/>src/todo/api/http/middleware/answer_failures/middleware.py
    participant Endpoint as ItemsHandler<br/>src/todo/api/http/endpoint/items.py
    participant Handler as PlanItemsHandler<br/>src/todo/command/plan_items.py

    Caller->>+RequestLog: POST /v1/items/plan
    RequestLog->>+AnswerFailures: the request
    AnswerFailures->>+Endpoint: the route of the contract
    Note over Endpoint: decodes the JSON body into PlanItems
    Endpoint->>+Handler: PlanItems, through the command middleware
    Handler-->>-Endpoint: the result, or an error with its kind
    Endpoint-->>-AnswerFailures: 200 with JSON, or the error
    Note over AnswerFailures: the kind to google.rpc.Status, a panic to INTERNAL
    AnswerFailures-->>-RequestLog: the answer
    Note over RequestLog: logs the request and the answer
    RequestLog-->>-Caller: the answer
